#~ "plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sila volana v dirkalnih igrah: sile centriranja in zavijanja,\n"
#~ "dekodirane iz ukazov igrine krmilne plošče volana,\n"
#~ "ter sunek ob trku, ko se v kaj zaletite."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "A gain on every force of the drive board. At 100 %, the\n"
#~ "board's full power (63) gives the wheel's full force, every\n"
#~ "force in proportion. 200 % doubles every force: those above\n"
#~ "half the board's power (32, Sega Rally's strongest torque)\n"
#~ "then saturate."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ojačanje vsake sile pogonske plošče. Pri 100 % da polna moč\n"
#~ "plošče (63) polno silo volana, vsaka sila sorazmerno. 200 %\n"
#~ "podvoji vsako silo: tiste nad polovico moči plošče (32,\n"
#~ "najmočnejši navor Sega Rallyja) se takrat nasičijo."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The centring spring of the Sega Rally Championship and\n"
#~ "Daytona USA cabinets: very light, it brings the wheel\n"
#~ "back and is barely felt when held against. A share of\n"
#~ "the resistance above. The other games' cabinets drive\n"
#~ "the wheel with no spring, and ignore this setting."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Centrirna vzmet avtomatov Sega Rally Championship in\n"
#~ "Daytona USA: zelo lahka, vrača volan in se je komaj čuti,\n"
#~ "ko se ji upiraš. Delež upora zgoraj. Avtomati drugih iger\n"
#~ "poganjajo volan brez vzmeti in te nastavitve ne upoštevajo."

