#~ "Daytona USA: switches 1-3, 4 times that.\n"
#~ "Indy 500, Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h:\n"
#~ "switches 1-1 to 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every force."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Moč motorja, nastavljena s stikali DIP pogonske plošče,\n"
#~ "stikala na ON šteta dvojiško: 0 = vsa OFF.\n"
#~ "Sega Rally: stikala 1-3, 0 do 7 prišteto vsakemu navoru.\n"
#~ "Daytona USA: stikala 1-3, štirikrat toliko. Indy 500, Touring\n"
#~ "Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h: stikala 1-1 do 1-3, 0 do 7\n"
#~ "prišteto vsaki sili."

